---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="How it works · Mental Note" active="how-it-works">
<div class="phead"><div class="wrap">
  <h1>How it works</h1>
</div></div>
<div class="light"><div class="block" style="padding-top:64px"><div class="wrap rv">
  <div class="stickies">
    <div class="stick s1 tape"><span>1</span>You write a note. You don't need an account or your name. Just write whatever's on your mind.</div>
    <div class="stick s2"><span>2</span>We read it. Both of us read every note, usually the same day or the next.</div>
    <div class="stick s3 tape"><span>3</span>We put it up on the wall. The only notes we leave off are ones that describe ways to hurt yourself or name a real person.</div>
    <div class="stick s4"><span>4</span>Someone else reads it. It stays on the wall for that week's theme, and after that it goes in the archive.</div>
  </div>

  <h2 class="asked">Questions people ask us</h2>
  <div class="talkqa">
    <p><b>Who reads my note?</b> Just the two of us.</p>
    <p><b>Is it anonymous?</b> Yes. We never ask for your name. If you sign up for our emails, that list is kept apart from the notes, so we can't match an email to a note.</p>
    <p><b>What if I'm not okay right now?</b> Please call or text 988, or text HOME to 741741. You'll reach a real person right away. A note can't get you help that fast.</p>
    <p><b>Do you see my check-ins in the app?</b> No. They stay on your phone.</p>
    <p><b>Are you therapists?</b> No. We're high school students.</p>
    <p><b>How is this paid for?</b> Donations. We don't run ads.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="acts" style="margin-top:44px"><a class="b1 dk" href="/this-week">Write a note</a></div>
</div></div></div>
</Layout>
